Trained OpenVLA and TraceVLA converge to nearly identical mid-layer peaks ($R^2 = 0.637$ at L9 vs.\ $0.634$ at L11; Appendix~\ref{sec:cross_arch_r2}), suggesting a shared mid-layer structure despite different reference starting points.
