The 32-layer attention profile (Figure~\ref{fig:synthesis_panels}, left) shows VLA-trained entry-exit concentration (L1: 24, L31: 18 heads), Llama-2 base mid-depth peak (L16: 25), and random initialization at 0 throughout.
